{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02833","headline":"同崔录事哭郑员外 · 卢照邻","name":"同崔录事哭郑员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文学秋天远，郎官星位尊。\n伊人表时彦，飞誉满司存。\n楚席光文雅，瑶山侍讨论。\n凤词凌汉阁，龟辩罩周园。\n已陪东岳驾，将逝北溟鲲。\n如何万化尽，空叹九飞魂。\n白马西京驿，青松北海门。\n夜台无晓箭，朝奠有虚尊。\n一代儒风没，千年陇雾昏。\n梁山送夫子，湘水吊王孙。\n仆本多悲泪，沾裳不待猿。\n闻君绝弦曲，吞恨更无言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02833.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02833","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}